Use wide intermediates for SPU2 master-volume multiplication.
Fixes polarity wrap with loud simultaneous voices in both batch and per-frame mixers.
Regression: tools/test/sound_regression.cpp fails before this patch and passes after it.
This does not establish the cause of every reported cutscene/dropout.

